At Novakid, we are on a mission to build the world’s best online education platform for children. With over 100,000 students and 4000 teachers, Novakid is already one of the most popular language learning platforms for children aged 4-12 across Europe and Asia. We are an advanced IT company of 450+ professionals.
We are looking for a Sales manager with knowledge of Turkish at the advanced / bi-lingual level.
Duties:

• Sell online English courses to our clients via phone and chats - working with refunds

Conditions:

• Remote work possible, any location

• 40 hours per week, morning and evening shifts (5 working days, but 2 working days on weekend)

• Interesting and promising project, please contact us!

Requirements
- Knowledge of English (at least B2, C1+ is better);
- Knowledge of Turkish- Advanced (at least C1/C2);
- Experience of working in a language school welcome;
- Experience of working in sales
- Experienced PC user;
- Organizational skills;
- Ability to work with a lot of information;
- Responsibility and care;
- Multi-tasking.
